## Run
```bash
python -m venv .venv && source .venv/bin/activate
pip install ansible boto3 botocore
ansible-galaxy collection install -r collections/requirements.yml
aws configure                                   # credentials for {{ aws_region }}

ansible-playbook preflight.yml
ansible-playbook site.yml --check
ansible-playbook site.yml
```

The ALB DNS name is your entry point; traffic is inspected by the WAF before it
reaches the instances. Use the Day-2 layer (`deploy.yml`) to ship your app onto
the auto-scaling instances (tagged `Role`-less here — tag them to target with deploy).

> Add HTTPS (an ACM cert on a 443 listener) and tune the WAF rule set for your app.
